      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quoting process was excellent.  Ian took into consideration our intention to install an EV charger and house battery in the not-too-distant future and provided a system design that accommodated those items, such as a hybrid inverter that is compatible with batteries from several manufacturers.  Answers to questions about the quote and information about other options were provided quickly and thoroughly.The installers showed up on time, worked efficently, and cleaned up everything afterward.   The installer described different placement options for the inverter and (future) battery, explaining the pros and cons of locating equipment in one location vs. another. He also answered a number of questions that I had about the installation of a (future) EV charger.  He helped me get the phone app connected to the inverter and checked that was working correctly and that the inverter was registered for warranty.",
