      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quoting process was simple and straightforward, not many details were required at all. Ian was able to answer the questions we had through email (our preferred correspondence) and provide us with the panels we wanted with no issues. Very competitive quote for LG panels and a 5kw Fronius inverter system.There was just a hiccup with the installation date (delayed by a week), but otherwise the process went without a hitch. The electricians who rocked up were polite, knowledgeable and worked out the panel layout for us on the spot. We wanted a East West system but didn't realise shading issues with the west side, so they managed to do a quick measure up and solve the issues with a 12-panel East + 6 panels on the North. Minimal issues with the concrete tiled roof that we have too, very satisfied with the install.The Energex network application was completed ahead of time, we already had a smart meter upgrade prior to the install which proved handy. Excellent job overall! Thanks UV Power!",
